# Cradle Reef (CIPlay cradle_reef): The Lullaby Frequency's sunken island, quest "Cradle Song" (7 steps). The home's
# shelf is flat round -14..12 0 (28 m under the sea); the dormitory spans -15..-6 x -4..2 (air pocket, zone dormitory
# at -10.5 -1), its cribs with the combs at z -2.4, the matron's table at -6.8 -0.6; the chapel spans 4..8.5 x -3..3 (zone
# chapel at its door, 6.25 -1; the music box on the altar at 6.25 2.1); the buoy at 14 -14 on its chain of posts.
# DEEP 10-25 (heights are the recipe's: the sea's surface at 34): Nursery Rock at -40 36 (top 54, foot zone hillfoot
# at -28.11 25.3 on the waterline), the infirmary at 55 38 (-8), the grotto's zone at 10 -57.
island Cradle Reef
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Cradle Song
wait 3
expect hidden tooth
zone buoy
expect step 1
zone dormitory
expect step 2
at -7.5 -0.6
read Matron's last letter
expect step 3
at -13.8 -1.4
use comb1
at -10.8 -1.4
use comb2
at -7.8 -1.4
use comb3
expect story comb 3
expect step 4
at 6.25 -3.5
zone chapel
wait 2
kill Angler fish
expect step 5
at 6.25 1
use musicbox
expect story comb 3
expect story boxsong 0
zone hillfoot
expect step 6
zone hilltop
expect step 7
read Nursemaid Ada Finch's note
expect step 8
open Nursemaid's chest
expect story windkey 1
expect step 9
zone deepward
expect step 10
air wardair
read Doctor Lewin Hale's note
expect step 11
zone kelpgrotto
read Elsie Cobb's slate
open Grotto box
expect step 11
at 6.25 1
use musicbox
expect story comb 0
expect story boxsong 1
expect shown tooth
expect step 12
use tooth
expect story tooth 1
expect done
